WEBVTT

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:13.980
You're too soft.

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:17.220
I'm just proceeding with caution.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:22.450
I will definitely capture them.

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:25.590
Any objections?

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:44.580
They aren't here either.

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:47.420
Where they expecting us?

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:48.850
There's no one here.

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:50.030
Okay. Fall back.

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:50.720
We're blowing it up.

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:22.020
It's just like what Nanafushi said.

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:28.470
Looks like the organization is getting impatient.

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:32.440
What kind of guys are they going to send now?

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:33.660
That isn't it.

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:35.690
They will be aiming directly for Shinobi Gakuen.

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:37.180
The school?

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:38.930
Like how they destroyed the boys' school?

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:43.100
But there's nobody in school anymore.

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:44.670
We're the only ones left.

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:49.030
According to my information, or rather, from the looks of the situation,

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:51.930
what they want is us, isn't it?

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:55.680
On top of that, when humans are driven into a corner they'll do just about anything.

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:00.080
I think you should take refuge.

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:05.420
If Nanafushi hadn't informed us,

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:08.700
we would have been blown to bits down there.

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:16.050
We can't go back to the school or the dormitory anymore.

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:21.160
If we go back to the village, they'll come there and bring trouble to teacher too.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:24.590
We don't have anywhere to return to.

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:36.650
Why okonomiyaki now?

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:41.370
Everybody,

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:42.660
don't you feel hungry?

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:44.660
I'm starving.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:46.260
Right?

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:49.780
When you're hungry, you can't come up with good ideas.

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:51.730
Let's fill up our tummies first.

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:54.670
You're always so energetic.

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:56.540
Yep!

00:04:58.410 --> 00:04:59.970
What should we do now?

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:03.040
Charge into wherever the enemies are, of course!

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:05.640
But we can't move recklessly now.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:10.090
The principal and the teachers are in league with them, right?

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:12.150
And what's more, that Takechi is behind all of this.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:18.660
Now we have no choice other than to wait for Nanafushi's contact.

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:24.220
I'm so full...

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:25.610
Himawari,

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:27.560
can I have seconds...

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.040
Huh? Where's Himawari?

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:34.180
She took away the last piece and went to greet the new neighbors.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:36.160
What do you mean?

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:40.750
Looks like her grandma told her to greet those living nearby when moving to a new place.

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.290
Let's eat.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:05:59.380
This taste...

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:07.800
The forest is...

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:26.070
Who's there?

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:41.100
It started raining...

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:42.830
Tsukiyohime-san!

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:45.090
I'm your classmate, Hinata Himawari.

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.650
Are you here?

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.370
Tsukiyohime-san!

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:55.170
I'm glad I found you.

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:56.920
Don't get soaked in the rain.

00:06:58.260 --> 00:06:59.540
Did you want something?

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:01.270
Oh, yeah.

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:04.300
We'll be staying in this forest for a while, so

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:06.140
the okonomiyaki is a greeting gift...

00:07:09.810 --> 00:07:12.300
But maybe it'll be edible after it dries.

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:13.120
Hey.

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:30.900
That girl really likes ninja.

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:35.160
She wanted to be a ninja,

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:38.370
and parted with her beloved grandma to come to Shinobi Gakuen.

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:43.610
We were destined to become ninja since we were born, but...

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:46.880
Himawari chose to become a ninja herself, right?

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:51.960
The one who's the most depressed about the loss of the school is probably Himawari.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:57.120
But she's still voraciously eating okonomiyaki just like she always does.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:01.800
Maybe she's just acting cheerful because she doesn't want us to see her being depressed.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.370
Thank goodness you're all fine.

00:08:10.770 --> 00:08:11.870
You have the right attitude.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:14.970
Nanafushi.

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:27.960
When it rained in my village,

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:32.520
I often used to watch the rain with my grandma on the porch.

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:34.350
Grandma?

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:36.950
The person who raised me.

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:37.970
I see.

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:42.530
When I was small, my parents died in an airplane accident,

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:44.640
and she raised me all on her own.

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:47.470
She was nice...

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:48.870
...and warm.

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:12.600
Tsukiyohime-san?

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:15.510
Tsu-Tsukiyohime-san!

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:18.520
I wonder where she went...

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:22.970
Hayato-dono!

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:32.080
Tsukiyohime-san said "don't get soaked in the rain."

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:37.720
Why don't you go back to your grandma's place?

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:43.980
What they want is Shikimi and the others who bear the superior genes.

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:45.190
They don't want us.

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:49.170
Then, do you mean that I should escape alone?

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:51.560
We won't know what they will do.

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:53.970
They even burnt the school.

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:56.440
You might really get killed.

00:09:56.440 --> 00:09:58.210
Will Hayato-dono run too?

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:01.120
I don't have anywhere to return to,

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:03.350
nor anybody who is waiting for me.

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:04.790
Besides that,

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:06.790
I'm a teacher.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:10.710
It's true that I'm a normal human unlike them,

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:13.650
but I'm still a ninja.

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:17.120
I will share the fate of my master and colleagues.

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:23.000
Why did you want to become a ninja?

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:24.740
Hayato-dono...

00:10:29.510 --> 00:10:31.760
You kill or get killed...

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:36.030
If you hadn't become a ninja, you could have lead a normal life with your grandma.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:37.660
Yet, you became one...

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:40.720
I...

00:10:56.090 --> 00:10:59.930
I was saved by a ninja when I was small.

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:05.010
Since then, I've always wanted to become a strong ninja who can protect somebody.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:07.040
I knew that.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:10.010
But if you die, all of that will be gone.

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:22.030
Don't you feel cold all of a sudden?

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:25.600
What's this?

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.030
It's cold...

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:51.480
Everybody, where are you going?

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.780
Himawari!

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:55.210
We're running away.

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:56.780
Running away?

00:11:56.780 --> 00:11:57.980
It's too cold.

00:11:57.980 --> 00:12:00.560
We're leaving this forest.

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:02.050
What's up?

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:04.000
Why did it go so cold all of a sudden?

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:06.340
I don't know,

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:09.610
but I'm sure it's due to this rain.

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:14.350
This rain and fog are taking away the warmth from this forest.

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:17.340
If we stay here, our warmth will be taken away too.

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:19.440
If we don't get away from here...

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:20.790
To where?

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:23.250
To the mountain where Yonezawa-kun is living.

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:25.090
Tsukiyohime-san.

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:29.960
Good timing.

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:31.100
Let's get away together.

00:12:31.970 --> 00:12:34.560
I am not planning on leaving.

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:36.740
When this forest dies,

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:38.100
so do I.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.430
Be rational.

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:45.110
We'll just retreat for now and reform.

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:49.270
If you want to leave, go ahead. I will stay.

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:52.090
It can't be helped. We're out of time.

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:52.860
Let's go.

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:53.350
Wait.

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:57.950
I will... stay here too.

00:12:58.510 --> 00:13:00.030
It's true that...

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:03.130
...if the organization wants to catch us,

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:05.100
it's no use even if we run into the mountains.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:06.520
Yes.

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:09.110
Wherever we run, they will come after us.

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:11.600
The damage will just get bigger.

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:13.640
In other words...

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:16.340
We'll just have to settle things with them here.

00:13:16.340 --> 00:13:18.020
Settle things with them...

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:20.130
But where are they now?

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:23.080
I have an idea.

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:45.790
This is the water source for the forest?

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:49.610
The water coming out from here will pass through the ground once more,

00:13:50.070 --> 00:13:52.580
and reach the vegetation of this forest.

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:57.150
If they seized this water,

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:58.310
the forest would be doomed.

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:04.560
Tsukiyohime-san.

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:20.500
Come out.

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:22.170
Show yourself.

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:38.520
It's too bad, but I was ordered to take you alive.

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:07.280
She did it!

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:17.030
Are you already finished?

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:20.200
If that's the case,

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:21.480
it's my turn now.

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:30.910
Good job.

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:32.710
This is...

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:41.710
It's cold...

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:46.350
I can't move.

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:51.130
My nose is freezing.

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:53.460
I'm getting sleepy...

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:56.520
You can't sleep.

00:16:56.520 --> 00:16:58.350
If this goes on,

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:00.460
we will all freeze to death.

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:06.970
Is this all right?

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:10.320
At this rate...

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:12.910
...you will kill them all.

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:19.280
But...

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:21.690
...they will retaliate if I stop.

00:17:27.140 --> 00:17:30.620
I can give you a hand.

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:34.200
Don't you want to catch them alive?

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:40.620
I will give them to you...

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:45.020
...if you promise that you will never lay a hand on the forest again.

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.330
You want to trade?

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:53.880
All right.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:58.220
As long as I can have them, I am not interested in this forest.

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:02.610
Wait. You're going to believe what she says?

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:04.220
Are you going to betray us?

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:07.520
We're comrades!

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:08.230
Comrades?

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:11.270
We are all students at Shinobi Gakuen.

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:14.960
To me, the only thing that's important is...

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:16.740
...this forest.

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:26.330
I don't want you to go back on your word after this.

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.250
Sign here.

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:29.250
Where. Show me.

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:33.500
H-Hey,

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:35.730
don't touch me!

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:37.490
Excuse me.

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:39.100
Let me see...

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:46.160
"Once I have received them, I will not rampage in the forest again."

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:48.840
Okay, just a thumb print will do?

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:57.650
Tsukiyohime-san.

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:58.850
H-Hey...

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:13.280
Are you serious?!

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:14.870
Traitor!

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:18.090
Good. Nicely done.

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:23.340
I was born and raised in this forest.

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:25.880
This is my hometown...

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:27.650
...and my house.

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:31.120
Everything in this forest is my family.

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:33.620
Family...

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:46.830
Live happily with your grandma.

00:19:52.760 --> 00:19:54.060
That was impressive.

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:56.290
Now, give them here.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:57.380
Take them.

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:13.530
What're you doing?

00:20:13.530 --> 00:20:15.760
Didn't I tell you not to kill them?

00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:17.120
Then,

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:18.630
haul them up yourself.

00:20:18.630 --> 00:20:20.620
What's with that attitude?

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:22.650
Are you in any position to say that?

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:24.570
You don't care what will become of the forest?

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:29.640
Stop that!

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:31.340
What're you doing?

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:33.770
Are you planning to melt me?

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:35.320
You'll die too.

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:36.880
L-Let me go!

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:49.120
Live happily with your grandma.

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:07.180
I-I'm melting.

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:10.690
This forest is my family,

00:21:10.690 --> 00:21:14.300
and those classmates are my comrades.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.150
I will protect both.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:18.220
If I can do that, I don't care what happens to me.

00:21:18.640 --> 00:21:21.770
Y-You're planning on dying with me?

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:22.590
That's right.

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:26.070
Let go! Let go!

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:27.680
No, I won't.

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:34.470
We will protect Tsukiyohime-san!

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:39.910
One, two...

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:41.950
One, two, one, two...

00:21:47.670 --> 00:21:49.250
The hot spring!

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.560
I-I'm melting!

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:54.570
I didn't imagine there would be a hidden hot spring!

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:56.260
It's hot!

00:21:56.260 --> 00:22:00.010
I'm melting...

00:22:03.430 --> 00:22:04.760
Tsukiyohime-san!

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:39.540
This kunoichi, Hinata Himawari, looks like an interesting subject.

00:22:41.160 --> 00:22:42.540
I wonder...

00:22:43.430 --> 00:22:47.970
Although, as a poor student, she's not in your list...

00:22:49.460 --> 00:22:51.280
But I want her.

00:22:52.400 --> 00:22:55.290
Hinata... Himawari.

00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:14.100
Kotarou-san, a friend of Hayato-dono, suddenly invited us out, but when we met him in the streets,

00:24:14.610 --> 00:24:23.340
he was all covered up in a trench coat, hat, mask, and sunglasses, and looked very suspicious.

00:24:23.890 --> 00:24:25.050
This man is probably...

00:24:26.180 --> 00:24:27.840
N-N-None!

00:24:28.300 --> 00:24:32.080
He doesn't have eyes, a nose, a mouth, or a face!

00:24:32.500 --> 00:24:32.820
Next time:

00:24:33.350 --> 00:24:35.570
"Yesterday's friend is today's enemy."

00:24:35.570 --> 00:24:39.170
Hayato-dono, isn't it nice to have friends?
